<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Locate</h1>
<p>There is no command to ask where someone is, but there are spells and 
skills that tell you:
</p>
<ul><li><a cmd='#'>Help Locate Person</a>: where a person is, anywhere in the world;</li>
<li><a cmd='#'>Help Locate Object</a>: where an object lies, or who carries it;</li>
<li><a cmd='#'>Help Locate Animal</a>: where an animal is;</li>
<li><a cmd='#'>Help Find Path</a>: the way to someone;</li>
<li><a cmd='#'>Help Track</a> and <a cmd='#'>Help Hunt</a>: follow someone's trail;</li>
<li><a cmd='#'>Help Sense Life</a>: who is in the room, even hidden.</li></ul>
<p><a cmd='#'>who</a> shows who is playing, but not where.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Locate Person</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Locate Object</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Who</a>
</pre>




</div>